==Battleground==
*1 [[Sagat (Enemy)|Sagat]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~16.67 seconds<sup>100f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Sagat is only at 7% magnification and the peons only 150%.

